                      %mi Hdg
                      %mrow
                        %mi k
                        %mo +
                        %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi Σ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Hdg^{k+1}(\Sigma)
              in prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HodgeCyclesAsPullbackOfHolomorphic"}
              is noteworthy in that it is analogous to the
              = succeed "-characterization" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber"} homotopy fiber
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Deligne+complex"} Deligne complex
              itself.
            %p
              Consider the following
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagram"} diagram
