              in the section on
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "differential+cohomology%20diagram#DeligneCoefficients"} Deligne coefficients
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+limit"} homotopy limit
              over this diagram – hence the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber"} homotopy fiber
              of the two maps – is a version of the
